| Category | Commands |
|----------|----------|
| Navigation | `pwd`, `cd`, `ls` |
| Directory | `mkdir`, `mkdir -p` |
| Disk | `df -h`, `du -h`, `df -i` |
| Memory | `free -h` |
| CPU | `top`, `uptime` |
| Search | `find`, `grep` |
| Logs | `head`, `tail`, `cat` |
| Services | `systemctl` |
| AWS | `ssh` |
| Packages | `yum`, `apt` |

